    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits redundancy pay for employees whose service is counted with the second employer";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) Subsection 22(5) does not apply (for the purpose of this Subdivision) to a transfer of employment between non-associated entities in relation to an employee if the second employer decides not to recognise the employee’s service with the first employer (for the purpose of this Subdivision).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(Employee is not entitled to redundancy pay if service with first employer counts as service with second employer)";
