    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Invalidates a term if it is not about permitted matters, unlawful terms, or designated outworker terms.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) it is not a term about a permitted matter; (b) it is an unlawful term; (c) it is a designated outworker term.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A term of an enterprise agreement has no effect to the extent that: (a) it is not a term about a permitted matter; or (b) it is an unlawful term; or (c) it is a designated outworker term.";
